  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong, cohesive defense-console art direction: disciplined near-black palette, restrained cyan/green/yellow semantics, distinctive radar graphic, and clear responsive restructuring. However, desktop metric values visibly overrun/crop within their columns, the desktop two-panel composition leaves excessive inert space, and mobile compresses dense evidence into very small low-contrast type. The global header also feels clipped rather than elegantly responsive on tablet/mobile, while the desktop header competes with oversized background lettering.",
    "fix": "Prevent metric overflow with responsive number sizing, rebalance the desktop illustration-to-data ratio, raise mobile evidence text size/contrast and spacing, and replace the clipped horizontal header treatment with a clearer compact navigation pattern.",
